                                                "sense_id": "12076463-8ab4-31fc-8879-542884372f15",
                                                "text": "He always contrived to sit next the door, to which he paid more attention than to his hearer; his eye always wandering to it as if he meditated an escape, and yet this man was the most audacious libeller of his time."
